  "title": "MyATM",
  "description": "Simple mod that add Game-to-Site connected debit cards and Terminals for in-game payment.",
  "body": "### Attention!\n- Works only with sites that has MyATM support.\n- You can find example of that type of sites [here](https://github.com/RealDodik/ExampleBank_For_MyATM).\n- License - MIT\n- You can get help or send bug reports on [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/NBshcdFrWQ) \n\n### How to Setup:\n- Run your site with MyATM support.\n- Put MyATM.jar into the \"mods\" folder.\n- Run the game and enter the world.\n- Put your bank_name, site_link and api_password (Check README in example site), from site to - myATM.cfg (There is Example in cfg).\n- Restart the game.\n- Rename your Card Linker on anvil into Bank_Name from myATM.cfg and place it.\n\n![Example of Card Linker renaming](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/153b58d9555c24c1c03f73fc6d0807f5839d0f7d.png)\n\n- Rename your Terminal into Bank_Name=Account_Number_From_Site (Example: GLTest=39576316) and place it.\n\n![Example of Terminal renaming](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/e8e4298f8fa7006d55f0b9e01fc87331370d1068.png)\n\n- Profit\n\n### How to use:\n- Create account on site.\n- Put blank card into ATM.\n\n![Prepare to link](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/a7ec74b984b46bdd82ab8c010128bacc2e734bd9.png)\n\n- Use you account data (Login and Password) and create PIN in ATM. It create card, linked to your account.\n\n![Linked card](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/51129d4a77295e7d9ac2a505b889ce7b8a4b8f2a.png)\n\n- Put your card in Terminal.\n\n![Ready to pay](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/908508ff5db89a3dc78bbf7128e2b960c4cfec88.png)\n\n- Enter amount and PIN to pay.\n\n![Payment done](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/15e6212276a1b12065d0b253182fae1109f92dcd.png)\n\n- How it looks on example site\n\n![Example site after payment](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/SkS98dyX/images/e1d8f44eadb3c47a84d85a43c5236b91d176d7ca.png)\n\n### In latest release:\n- Multiple banks support. (add new lines with 'bank_name':'site_link':'api_password' in myATM.cfg)\n- Simple and fast in-game payment.\n- Improved block textures.\n- Replace green text in Terminal with in-GUI light signal.\n\n### Soon:\n- Simplified addition of new currencies (currently only through code changes).\n- Multiple cards on account.\n- Clear separation of cards from different banks\n- Depositing and withdrawing cash from an ATM\n\n",
  "body_url": null,
